0017da4b290ae21e807ca61bc18f76315fece3b"], "node": "cdcdb1130be225a2afde5f0614101676ad8381ed", "parents": ["9df840d2cc40e6c925f586233e3c329ba38509f2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786630760, "git_changesets": ["60017da4b290ae21e807ca61bc18f76315fece3b", "efb84a55c54e0cad9af28b33a8bed4d5694d8d95"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "266": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csledru@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052502 - Fix out-of-bounds read in LinuxGamepad by sizing key_map/abs_map with KEY_CNT/ABS_CNT (Coverity CID 1585304)  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nkey_map/abs_map were sized [KEY_MAX]/[ABS_MAX], but evdev admits EV_KEY codes up to KEY_MAX inclusive, so event.code == KEY_MAX read one past the end. Size the arrays and population loops with KEY_CNT/ABS_CNT (matching keyBits/absBits), and bound the untrusted event.code before indexing key_map.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310336\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318481\n", "files": ["dom/gamepad/linux/LinuxGamepad.cpp"], "git_node": "32f78303674d580169f5e4dbd5120ef293b09cad", "git_parents": ["efb84a55c54e0cad9af28b33a8bed4d5694d8d95"], "node": "71984b4f95141f8fb1c06b867e2fceedf63eede0", "parents": ["cdcdb1130be225a2afde5f0614101676ad8381ed"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786675011, "git_changesets": ["32f78303674d580169f5e4dbd5120ef293b09cad"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "267": {"changesets": [{"author": "Pier Angelo Vendrame \u003cpierov@torproject.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2039206 - Wire WindowDevicePixelRatio to image-set.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D300449\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314310\n", "files": ["dom/base/ResponsiveImageSelector.cpp", "layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "toolkit/components/resistfingerprinting/tests/browser/browser_srcset.js", "toolkit/components/resistfingerprinting/tests/