ipt: URI handling in LoadHistoryEntry.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nPer spec, javascript: URIs are never stored in SH. Neither has this code test\ncoverage, nor does the test on the bug that introduced it still pass.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314860\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319681\n", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "docshell/shistory/SessionHistoryEntry.cpp"], "git_node": "d463f947a8be0c76c64ec7550c5d927cabd28a53", "git_parents": ["309e88ef43bc511f52065cd3777e884f10eea526"], "node": "68ef01ebab6011f45fe51fa566ecf55cb0422be8", "parents": ["b0a0497a8351055bd142ffb77b13513040b1edff"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787254251, "git_changesets": ["d463f947a8be0c76c64ec7550c5d927cabd28a53"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "361": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060008.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315941\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319677\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawTargetCairo.cpp"], "git_node": "36773e5fa4ab5c9222b427aaa1f1eb49c65177fb", "git_parents": ["d463f947a8be0c76c64ec7550c5d927cabd28a53"], "node": "5b54132ed30b1108d1eee22432e9596b325dab84", "parents": ["68ef01ebab6011f45fe51fa566ecf55cb0422be8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787254273, "git_changesets": ["36773e5fa4ab5c9222b427aaa1f1eb49c65177fb"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "362": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kershaw Chang \u003ckershaw@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061397 - Tear down WebSocketChannelChild on the main thread,  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nUse the same approach HttpChannelChild::Release() uses: dispatch off-main-thread\nreleases through the main thread with DecrementWithLimit\u003c2\u003e, so the count==1\nSendDeleteSelf and count==0 delete only run on the main thread where the IPDL\nreference is also released.\n\nOriginal 