/phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320477\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/apple/AppleVTEncoder.cpp"], "git_node": "350287c18651401edfdadb7d83f0b9b329fac379", "git_parents": ["6f9cfc4dfeb0442db2f904ce8a7a0cf90aa6cd4a"], "node": "553ffa2a790516864fb321d6b1b63fc2d97bfd97", "parents": ["867d9541d7361459ac47c52bc4d1288f92b2e64a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049474 - Add NVImage AppleVT encode test  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nEncode and drain an NV12 NVImage through AppleVT, validating the emitted AVCC bitstream.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318169\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320478\n", "files": ["dom/media/gtest/TestMediaDataEncoder.cpp"], "git_node": "f3997380a4e5d6a98209db7ec6996306fe127d5e", "git_parents": ["350287c18651401edfdadb7d83f0b9b329fac379"], "node": "b66ecfa44fec66a086f812f72b6e8f25a3d68d64", "parents": ["553ffa2a790516864fb321d6b1b63fc2d97bfd97"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059965 - Copy mapped AppleVT inputs before submission  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nCopy packed source pixels into an owned CVPixelBuffer while their map is live, so VideoToolbox never receives a scoped map address.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318170\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320479\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/apple/AppleVTEncoder.cpp"], "git_node": "7813982e0244bfc63bee679afd920b501f1e6725", "git_parents": ["f3997380a4e5d6a98209db7ec6996306fe127d5e"], "node": "79ffb66d98a0d2b1338cf6e82ee5ebae82d7cab8", "parents": ["b66ecfa44fec66a086f812f72b6e8f25a3d68d64"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787410423, "git_changesets": ["350287c18651401edfdadb7d83f0b9b329fac379", "f3997380a4e5d6a98209db7ec6996306fe127d5e", "7813982e0244bfc63bee679afd920b501f1e6725"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "373": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andy Leiserson \u003caleiserson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059002.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320614\n", "files": ["dom/webgpu/Device.cpp", "dom/webgpu/Utility.cpp", "dom/webgpu/Utility.h", "dom/webgpu/ipc/WebGPUParent.cpp", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/client.rs", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/lib.rs", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/server.rs", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/meta/webgpu/cts/webgpu/api/validation/capability_checks/features/texture_formats/cts.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/meta/webgpu/cts/webgpu/api/validation/render_pipeline/fragment_state/cts.https.html.ini"], "git_node": "e6800db63fc9d6fefa2cd9015bb2275bee738c0d", "git_parents": ["7813982e0244bfc63bee679afd920b501f1e6725"], "node": "612e139f751681165f327a6b4061a2ca6eec95b1", "parents": ["79ffb66d98a0d2b1338cf6e82ee5ebae82d7cab8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787410491, "git_changesets": ["e6800db63fc9d6fefa2cd9015bb2275bee738c0d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "374": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058087 p1 - Pre-create shader-cache to allow read only rule.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317559\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320392\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/win/src/sandboxbroker/sandboxBroker.cpp"], "git_node": "978cec0a92a69d07dfc1bd20a2c4ac5d3f887b97", "git_parents": ["e6800db63fc9d6fefa2cd9015bb2275bee738c0d"], "node": "0255495bf271ac1064071d548c7635902d8c2615", "parents": ["612e139f751681165f327a6b4061a2ca6eec95b1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058087 p2 - Block directory creation and only allow read access.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317560\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320393\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium-shim/patches/55_dont_broker_dir_creation_or_write.patch", "security/sandbox/chromium/sandbox/win/src/filesystem_dispatcher.cc"], "git_node": "6561145a124ad1beccdfa94be79304cca834849e", "git_parents": ["978cec0a92a69d07dfc1bd20a2c4ac5d3f887b97"], "node": "15935e13b1c28f68a8023f872d8254d52f8f87e6", "parents": ["0255495bf271ac1064071d548c7635902d8c2615"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787410587, "git_changesets": ["978cec0a92a69d07dfc1bd20a2c4ac5d3f887b97", "6561145a124ad1beccdfa94be79304cca834849e"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "375": {"changesets": [{"author": "Bob Owen \u003cbobowencode@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058101 - Use OpenKeyAction for RegistryDispatcher::NtCreateKey.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D318175\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320426\n", "files": ["security/sandbox/chromium-shim/sandbox/win/src/registry_dispatcher.cc", "security/sandbox/chromium-shim/sandbox/win/src/registry_policy.cc", "security/sandbox/chromium-shim/sandbox/win/src/registry_policy.h"], "git_node": "1955292a8bf4830775c0cf0a294fd0805e9d9810", "git_parents": ["6561145a124ad1beccdfa94be79304cca834849e"], "node": "063a6b2eb7d5143cd2e44e1c45b8ef729bbced6f", "parents": ["15935e13b1c28f68a8023f872d8254d52f8f87e6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787410613, "git_changesets": ["1955292a8bf4830775c0cf0a294fd0805e9d9810"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "376": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan Grulich \u003cjgrulich@redhat.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059127 - WebRTC backport: Screen capture: validate and snapshot cursor and videocrop metadata  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nCap cursor_meta-\u003esize against the negotiated maximum and validate that\nbitmap_offset and the bitmap pixel data offset both point within the\nmetadata region before forming pointers and copying data.\n\nCopy cursor and videocrop metadata headers from shared memory into\nlocal storage before validating and using their fields, so the\nproducer cannot modify them between validation and use.\n\nThis is a simple backport of an WebRTC upstream change.\n\nUpstream commit: 9b33b6c524a185a20586741af262370291000b69\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319761\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320338\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/modules/desktop_capture/linux/wayland/shared_screencast_stream.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/moz-patch-stack/9b33b6c524.no-op-cherry-pick-msg"], "git_node": "88da28d78297f978905bd29e71581cf47c14594e", "git_parents": ["1955292a8bf4830775c0cf0a294fd0805e9d9810"], "node": "7e4a0f2a929a1a3ab4faa4cfcc84f74d116b890a", "parents": ["063a6b2eb7d5143cd2e44e1c45b8ef729bbced6f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787410637, "git_changesets": ["88da28d78297f978905bd29e71581cf47c14594e"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "377": {"changesets": [{"author": "mimi \u003cmjung@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059393 - Revert using uncached defaultBrowserCheck for set to default app menu messages  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319181\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320548\n", "files": ["browser/components/asrouter/modules/OnboardingMessageProvider.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "9dc2571806bdc389708b79df415ae2c051017f33", "git_parents": ["88da28d78297f978905bd29e71581cf47c14594e"], "node": "201b794be40859af7daa319e88ab4f7ac1033d8a", "parents": ["7e4a0f2a929a1a3ab4faa4cfcc84f74d116b890a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1787410694, "git_changesets": ["9dc2571806bdc389708b79df415ae2c051017f33"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "378": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061505.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.servi